venue_r12":1054.0,"ebit_r12":164.0,"net_income_r12":7.0,"equity":1093.0,"assets":3605.0,"model_ready":"True"},{"period":"2019-12-31","published":"2020-02-20","kind":"","revenue":751.0,"ebit":380.0,"net_income":171.0,"revenue_r12":751.0,"ebit_r12":380.0,"net_income_r12":171.0,"equity":1183.0,"assets":3999.0,"model_ready":"True"},{"period":"2020-12-31","published":"2021-02-24","kind":"","revenue":2358.0,"ebit":906.0,"net_income":688.0,"revenue_r12":2358.0,"ebit_r12":906.0,"net_income_r12":688.0,"equity":1733.0,"assets":5297.0,"model_ready":"True"}],"news":[{"date":"2026-10-21T05:45","title":"Magnolia Bostad delårsrapport jan–sep 2026: Positivt kvartalsresultat och andra affären med Hines","url":"https://mfn.se/a/magnolia-bostad/magnolia-bostad-delarsrapport-jan-sep-2026-positivt-kvartalsresultat-och-andra-affaren-med-hines","tags":["report","report:interim","report:interim:q3"]},{"date":"2026-10-21T05:45","title":"Magnolia Bostad interim report Jan–Sep 2026: Positive quarterly results and second transaction with Hines","url":"https://mfn.se/a/magnolia-bostad/magnolia-bostad-interim-report-jan-sep-2026-positive-quarterly-results-and-second-transaction-with-hines","tags":["report","report:interim","report:interim:q3"]},{"date":"2026-10-01T07:25","title":"Correction: Magnolia Bostad sells 197 residential units to Hines","url":"https://mfn.se/a/magnolia-bostad/magnolia-bostad-sells-197-residential-units-to-hines-1","tags":["ci","ci:other"]},{"date":"2026-10-01T07:25","title":"Rättelse: Magnolia Bostad säljer 197 bostäder till Hines","url":"https://mfn.se/a/magnolia-bostad/magnolia-bostad-saljer-197-bostader-till-hines-1","tags":["ci","ci:other"]},{"date":"2026-10-01T05:00","title":"Magnolia Bostad sells 197 residential units to Hines","url":"https://mfn.se/a/magnolia-bostad/magnolia-bostad-sells-197-residential-units-to-hines","tags":["ci","ci:other"]},{"date":"2026-10-01T05:00","title":"Magnolia Bostad säljer 197 bostäder till Hines","url":"https://mfn.se/a/magnolia-bostad/magnolia-bostad-saljer-197-bostader-till-hines","tags":["ci","ci:other"]},{"date":"2026-07-08T05:45","title":"Magnolia Bostad Interim Report Jan–Jun 2026","url":"https://mfn.se/a/magnolia-bostad/magnolia-bostad-interim-report-jan-jun-2026","tags":["report","report:interim","report:interim:q2"]},{"date":"2026-07-08T05:45","title":"Magnolia Bostad delårsrapport jan–jun 2026","url":"https://mfn.se/a/magnolia-bostad/magnolia-bostad-delarsrapport-jan-jun-2026","tags":["report","report:interim","report:interim:q2"]}],"events":[{"date":"2026-10-21","title":"Magnolia Bostad delårsrapport jan–sep 2026: Positivt kvartalsresultat och andra affären med Hines","text":"Magnolia Bostad redovisar ett rörelseresultat om 67 mkr (-29) och ett resultat efter skatt om 13 mkr (-83) för det tredje kvartalet. Under kvartalet avyttrades projektet Konduktören i Veddesta, Järfälla, om 197 hyreslägenheter till Hines genom forward funding. Mats Brandt, VD, Magnolia Bostad: “Det är glädjande att den ökade aktiviteten i bolaget nu syns i resultatet, och att vi idag står bättre rustade att ta tillvara möjligheterna i en marknad som tagit fart. Bostadsprojektet Konduktören visar vår förmåga att agera snabbt på nya affärsmöjligheter. Fokus ligger på att omsätta det ökade intresset i fler affärer nära vår kärnkompetens, där vi har bäst förutsättningar att skapa värde.” 1 januari – 30 september 2026 * Nettoomsättningen uppgick till 485 mkr (405). * Rörelseresultatet uppgick till -20 mkr (-190). * Resultat efter skatt uppgick till -173 mkr (-366). 1 juli – 30 september 2026 * Nettoomsättningen uppgick till 176 mkr (23). * Rörelseresultatet uppgick till 67 mkr (-29). * Resultat efter skatt uppgick till 13 mkr (-83). Händelser 1 juli – 30 september 2026 * Sålt projektet Konduktören i Veddesta, Järfälla, om 197 hyreslägenheter till Hines genom forward funding. * Slutfinansierat de färdigställda etapperna B och C i Öresjö Ängar i Borås, om totalt 134 lägenheter. Händelser efter periodens utgång * Inga väsentliga händelser har inträffat efter periodens utgång. ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ För mer information, vänligen kontakta: Mats Brandt, VD mats.brandt@magnoliabostad.se Svenjo Behrens, Tf. CFO svenjo.behrens@magnoliabostad.se Erik Tobisson, Finansieringsansvarig & IR +46 70 050 52 40, erik.tobisson@magnoliabostad.se Denna information är sådan information som Magnolia Bostad AB är skyldigt att offentliggöra enligt EU:s marknadsmissbruksförordning. Informationen lämnades, genom ovanstående kontaktpersoners försorg, för offentliggörande den 2026-10-21 07:45 CEST. ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ Om Magnolia Bostad Magnolia Bostad (publ), org.nr 556797–7078 är en bostadsutvecklare som utvecklar nya boenden i attraktiva lägen i Sveriges storstadsområden. Sedan bolaget grundades 2009 har vi byggt 16 000 bostäder till ett värde av 30 mdkr. Verksamheten bedrivs från kontor i Stockholm och Göteborg. Vårt arbete styrs av en helhetssyn där verksamheten bedrivs på ett sätt som främjar en långsiktigt hållbar samhällsutveckling. Bolagets obligationer är noterade på Nasdaq Stockholm. Mer information på www.magnoliabostad.se ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ Bifogade filer Delårsrapport Jan Sep 2026 Sv (https://storage.mfn.se/273e5246-8693-463b-91c5-abe38a464554/delarsrapport-jan-sep-2026-sv.pdf)"},{"date":"2026-10-21","title":"Magnolia Bostad interim report Jan–Sep 2026: Positive quarterly results and second transaction with Hines","text":"Magnolia Bostad reported an operating profit of SEK 67 m (-29) and a profit after tax of SEK 13 m (-83) for the third quarter. During the quarter, the Konduktören project in Veddesta, Järfälla, comprising 197 rental apartments, was sold to Hines through a forward funding arrangement. Mats Brandt, CEO, Magnolia Bostad: “It is gratifying that the increased activity in the company is now reflected in our earnings, and that we are now better positioned to capitalise on opportunities in a market that has gained momentum. The Konduktören residential project demonstrates our ability to act quickly on new business opportunities. Our focus is on converting this greater interest into more business within our core areas of expertise, where we are best positioned to create value.” 1 January – 30 September 2026 * Net sales amounted to SEK 485 m (405). * The operating loss was SEK 20 m (-190). * The loss after tax was SEK 173 m (-366). 1 July – 30 September 2026 * Net sales amounted to SEK 176 m (23). * The operating profit was SEK 67 m (-29). * The profit after tax was SEK 13 m (-83). Events 1 July – 30 September 2026 * The Konduktören project in Veddesta, Järfälla, comprising 197 rental apartments, was sold to Hines through forward funding. * Long-term financing was secured for the completed stages B and C of Öresjö Ängar in Borås, totalling 134 apartments. Events after the end of the period * No significant events have occurred after the end of the period. ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ For more information, please contact: Mats Brandt, CEO mats.brandt@magnoliabostad.se Svenjo Behrens, Acting CFO svenjo.behrens@magnoliabostad.se Erik Tobisson, Head of Financing & IR +46 70 050 52 40, erik.tobisson@magnoliabostad.se (mailto:Erik.Tobisson@magnoliabostad.se) This information is information that Magnolia Bostad AB is obliged to make public pursuant to the EU Market Abuse Regulation. The information was submitted for publication, through the agency of the contact persons set out above, at 2026-10-21 07:45 CEST. ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ About Magnolia Bostad Magnolia Bostad (publ), co. reg. no. 556797–7078, is a property developer that develops new housing in attractive locations in Sweden's metropolitan areas. Since the company was founded in 2009, we have built 16,000 homes with a total value of SEK 30 billion. The company operates from offices in Stockholm and Göteborg. Our work is guided by a holistic approach where business is carried out in a way that promotes long-term sustainable urban development. The company's bonds are listed on Nasdaq Stockholm. More information is available at www.magnoliabostad.se ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ Attachments Interim Report Jan Sep 2026 Eng (https://storage.mfn.se/609635e6-7747-43fe-8c0e-e821b7203bf9/interim-report-jan-sep-2026-eng.pdf)"}],"insider":[],"short":{"date":"2026-10-27","positions":[]},"owners":[],"targets":[],"adviser":{"decisions":[],"thesis":null}}